Third-party attributions

WeChat article search (src/engines/wechat/wechat-article.ts)

  The implementation approach — establishing a session via the Sogou homepage
  to obtain the anti-crawler cookie, then reassembling the signed WeChat
  article URLs from the redirect page's script fragments — was informed by
  Miku_Spider (https://github.com/GobinFan/Miku_Spider), which is licensed
  under the MIT License.

  No source code and no cookie values from that project are included here;
  the module is an independent TypeScript implementation, and all session
  cookies are obtained dynamically at runtime. Attribution is provided for
  the design approach with thanks to its authors.

